  s0: Nothing started
  s1: Resting on Play
  s2: Play pressed
  s3: The warm-up holds the claim
  s4: Play builds
  s5: The warm-up's claim is past 3 minutes
  s6: Stream prepared, Play not pressed
  s7: Couldn't start
  s8: Picture ready
  s9: Play waits on the warm-up
  s10: Two builds of one title
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you rest on Play
  s0 --> s2: you press Play
  s1 --> s3: the warm-up starts
  s1 --> s2: you press Play
  s2 --> s4: Play takes the build or Play takes over the expired claim
  s3 --> s2: you press Play
  s3 --> s5: 3 minutes pass
  s3 --> s0: the warm-up fails
  s3 --> s6: the warm-up finishes
  s4 --> s7: Play's build fails
  s4 --> s8: Play's build finishes
  s2 --> s9: Play finds a build running
  s5 --> s0: the warm-up fails
  s5 --> s6: the warm-up finishes
  s5 --> s2: you press Play
  s6 --> s2: you press Play
  s2 --> s10: Play takes over the expired claim
  s2 --> s8: Play finds a prepared stream
  s10 --> s4: the warm-up dies or the warm-up fails or the warm-up finishes
  s10 --> s7: Play's build fails
  s10 --> s8: Play's build finishes
  s9 --> s2: the build is over, or its 3 minutes are up
